#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/darken.rst:85
msgid "Left: **Normal**. Right: **Fog Darken** (exactly the same as Addition)."
msgstr ""
"Vänster: **Normal**. Höger: **Mörkare dimma** (exakt samma sak som addition)."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/darken.rst:95
msgid "This blending mode is called \"Darken\" in English."
msgstr "Blandningsläget kallas \"Darken\" på engelska."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/darken.rst:97
msgid ""
"With the darken, the upper layer's colors are checked for their lightness. "
"Only if they are darker than the underlying color on the lower layer, will "
"they be visible."
msgstr ""
"Med gör mörkare kontrolleras ljusheten hos det övre lagrets färger. Det är "
"bara om de är mörkare än de underliggande färgen på det undre lagret som de "
"blir synliga."

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/darken.rst:99
msgid ""
"Is Lighter Gray(0.5, 0.5, 0.5) darker than Darker Gray(0.4, 0.4, 0.4)? = "
"(no, no, no) → Darker Gray(0.4, 0.4, 0.4)"
msgstr ""
"Är ljusgrå(0.5, 0.5, 0.5) mörkare än mörkgrå(0.4, 0.4, 0.4)? = (nej, nej, "
"nej) → mörkgrå(0.4, 0.4, 0.4)"

